<section
  aria-labelledby="where-the-value-comes-from"
  class="bg-background-inverted px-6 py-20 md:py-[104px]"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1090px] items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,568px)_minmax(0,375px)] lg:justify-between lg:gap-9">
    <h2
      id="where-the-value-comes-from"
      class="text-[40px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em] text-text-inverse-primary md:text-[52px]"
    >
      <span class="block">Your hours. </span>
      <span class="block">Your standards. </span>
      <span class="block text-gradient-heading">
        A budget that <br class="max-lg:hidden" />
        goes further.
      </span>
    </h2>
    <ol class="flex flex-col">
      <li class="py-8 md:py-10">
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="block font-mono text-[11px] leading-4 font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-text-inverse-accent"
        >
          01
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-balance text-[26px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-text-inverse-primary md:text-[32px]">
          Answers <br class="max-lg:hidden" />
          the same day.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] tracking-[-0.02em] text-text-inverse-tertiary">
          They work while your team works, so reviews, decisions and fixes
          happen in hours, with nobody waiting overnight for a reply.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="py-8 md:py-10">
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="block font-mono text-[11px] leading-4 font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-text-inverse-accent"
        >
          02
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-balance text-[26px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-text-inverse-primary md:text-[32px]">
          Fluent in how <br class="max-lg:hidden" />
          US teams work.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] tracking-[-0.02em] text-text-inverse-tertiary">
          English, async updates, the pace of a sprint. It’s part of what we
          assess before you meet anyone.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="py-8 md:py-10">
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="block font-mono text-[11px] leading-4 font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-text-inverse-accent"
        >
          03
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-balance text-[26px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-text-inverse-primary md:text-[32px]">
          The senior hire, <br class="max-lg:hidden" />
          within reach.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] tracking-[-0.02em] text-text-inverse-tertiary">
          Nearshore rates mean the seniority your role needs can fit the budget
          you already have.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
